WEBVTT

00:24.896 --> 00:28.000
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

00:31.123 --> 00:34.080
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

00:37.216 --> 00:40.736
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

00:42.656 --> 00:47.712
♪I've become the center of the story♪

00:48.608 --> 00:52.978
♪I must escape this dream♪

00:54.560 --> 00:59.160
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

01:00.128 --> 01:04.032
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

01:04.352 --> 01:06.528
♪A fake world♪

01:07.232 --> 01:12.224
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

01:37.088 --> 01:40.896
=My Page in the 90s=
(Adapted from "Bye, Wild Weasel")

01:41.084 --> 01:44.008
=Episode 18=

02:12.700 --> 02:14.300
You've actually come a long way.

02:14.899 --> 02:16.420
You're just not on your game today.

02:17.179 --> 02:18.260
No need to comfort me.

02:18.700 --> 02:20.540
I can handle this little setback myself.

02:21.100 --> 02:22.179
I'm not comforting you.

02:22.339 --> 02:23.339
Just stating the facts.

02:24.459 --> 02:25.980
Back at the police academy,

02:26.380 --> 02:29.059
lots of students had shaky hands
when they held their guns,

02:30.179 --> 02:32.140
afraid of being laughed at
for missing the target,

02:32.580 --> 02:33.619
and of failure.

02:34.100 --> 02:35.339
But later, we realized

02:35.860 --> 02:37.540
that only when you achieve something

02:38.140 --> 02:39.020
do people see you.

02:39.260 --> 02:40.939
Before that,
no one cares about you at all.

02:43.420 --> 02:45.219
Are you talking
about my singing competition?

02:48.700 --> 02:50.100
You could've just said it straight.

02:50.100 --> 02:51.219
Don't beat around the bush.

02:52.619 --> 02:53.540
You're right.

02:54.020 --> 02:56.420
If I ever really became a singer,

02:56.700 --> 02:58.059
watched by everyone every day,

02:59.820 --> 03:01.739
I might even forget how to walk.

03:02.059 --> 03:03.899
Singing isn't really my thing,

03:05.420 --> 03:06.300
but shooting is.

03:07.140 --> 03:10.939
I think only when you see nothing
but the target

03:11.260 --> 03:12.580
can you truly focus.

03:13.100 --> 03:14.380
Because you know anything else

03:14.380 --> 03:15.300
is irrelevant to you.

03:16.300 --> 03:16.872
So?

03:16.980 --> 03:18.260
Want to give this method a try?

03:22.459 --> 03:23.619
Then I'll try once more.

04:00.619 --> 04:01.219
So?

04:01.499 --> 04:02.739
Not so nervous now, right?

04:04.820 --> 04:05.659
Much better.

04:09.179 --> 04:09.939
I've decided.

04:10.659 --> 04:11.540
I'll give it a shot.

04:14.980 --> 04:16.940
All of you have tried hard to help me.

04:17.219 --> 04:18.580
If I back out now,

04:18.899 --> 04:19.979
I'd be such a coward.

04:20.700 --> 04:22.380
It's okay. Just as you said,

04:22.659 --> 04:23.500
focus my attention.

04:23.500 --> 04:24.339
Keep my mind clear.

04:24.940 --> 04:26.020
I won't feel nervous.

04:27.140 --> 04:27.700
Right.

04:28.620 --> 04:29.700
Nothing matters

04:30.580 --> 04:32.060
but firing the first shot.

04:34.859 --> 04:35.659
What about you?

04:36.299 --> 04:37.459
Your shooting was so good.

04:37.620 --> 04:39.659
You became a good detective,
just as you wanted.

04:40.060 --> 04:41.180
Why did you quit?

04:46.979 --> 04:48.060
If you don't want to tell,

04:48.580 --> 04:49.380
it's okay.

05:03.099 --> 05:04.872
I wanted to be a detective
because of my dad.

05:05.859 --> 05:09.659
I wanted to be a good police officer,
just like him.

05:11.979 --> 05:13.260
But after he died at his post,

05:15.020 --> 05:17.299
I started feeling afraid.

05:18.979 --> 05:20.419
It was one of my dad's colleagues

05:20.580 --> 05:22.060
who pulled me out of that state.

05:22.700 --> 05:25.620
He said that when people are scared,

05:26.060 --> 05:27.099
they often feel fear.

05:27.899 --> 05:28.740
That's normal.

05:29.099 --> 05:31.140
But it doesn't mean you're cowardly,

05:31.500 --> 05:33.299
nor does it mean
you'll avoid things forever.

05:35.099 --> 05:36.779
So, I felt much better then.

05:39.180 --> 05:39.899
But...

05:42.740 --> 05:43.620
Because of my mom,

05:46.500 --> 05:47.380
I decided to quit.

05:56.299 --> 05:57.299
So,

05:58.620 --> 06:00.180
you still want to be a detective?

06:10.380 --> 06:11.539
You're different from me.

06:12.299 --> 06:13.380
You have huge potential.

06:14.899 --> 06:17.020
All you need to do first
is overcome your fear.

06:22.779 --> 06:24.779
Remember back in school,

06:24.779 --> 06:26.060
when I was singing on stage?

06:26.380 --> 06:28.020
I cracked a note because of a cold,

06:28.020 --> 06:29.180
and everyone laughed at me.

06:29.859 --> 06:31.740
But all I remember is you

06:32.820 --> 06:33.700
shining brightly.

06:47.260 --> 06:49.339
I wasn't that great.

06:51.859 --> 06:52.979
You just didn't realize it.

06:53.700 --> 06:54.380
So,

06:54.700 --> 06:56.099
don't care about what others think.

06:56.659 --> 06:58.700
You only need to know
you're singing for yourself

06:59.700 --> 07:01.180
and the people who like you.

07:28.380 --> 07:29.060
Gao Haiming.

07:32.620 --> 07:33.339
Chairman.

07:34.020 --> 07:34.740
Where is he?

07:35.500 --> 07:36.500
Mr. Gao isn't here now.

07:38.020 --> 07:38.580
Come here.

07:43.700 --> 07:44.899
Whose idea was this?

07:45.128 --> 07:46.056
(Perfect Blend of Looks and Talent)

07:47.219 --> 07:48.060
It was my idea.

07:48.779 --> 07:49.580
Your idea?

07:50.419 --> 07:51.700
The response has been good.

07:51.700 --> 07:53.099
The market speaks for itself.

07:53.099 --> 07:55.180
This idea shouldn't be a problem, right?

07:55.659 --> 07:57.219
What do you mean by that?

07:57.659 --> 08:00.659
A man endorsing sanitary pad products!

08:00.899 --> 08:02.140
Is that not a problem?

08:02.380 --> 08:04.260
He is utterly shameless!

08:04.459 --> 08:05.500
What was he thinking?

08:06.899 --> 08:09.060
Letao has been selling sanitary pads
all these years.

08:09.659 --> 08:11.299
You don't feel ashamed
when making money.

08:12.260 --> 08:13.480
But you do when I endorse it?

08:14.060 --> 08:15.620
Products are products.

08:15.620 --> 08:16.779
You are my son.

08:16.779 --> 08:18.979
How can you get involved
in this type of product?

08:19.219 --> 08:20.979
You're embarrassing me!

08:21.500 --> 08:23.180
Chairman, please calm down.

08:24.060 --> 08:25.940
This is something he enjoys doing.

08:26.419 --> 08:27.859
And the sales are so good.

08:28.459 --> 08:29.979
Why can't you support him?

08:30.099 --> 08:31.060
What should I support?

08:32.260 --> 08:33.740
Male Lead's fondness toward you,

08:33.819 --> 08:35.860
87 percent, 88 percent.

08:36.059 --> 08:37.460
I'm talking to my son!

08:37.699 --> 08:38.740
None of your business!

08:39.380 --> 08:40.072
Chairman.

08:40.620 --> 08:41.224
Gao.

08:41.460 --> 08:42.740
I could hear you shouting

08:43.020 --> 08:43.899
from a mile away.

08:43.899 --> 08:45.860
We're in the company.
Mind your behavior.

08:46.100 --> 08:47.100
You came just in time.

08:47.340 --> 08:48.620
You're responsible for this.

08:48.779 --> 08:49.299
What?

08:49.299 --> 08:50.380
You persuaded me

08:50.779 --> 08:52.899
to turn him loose, right?

08:52.980 --> 08:54.419
Look at what he's done now.

08:54.620 --> 08:56.779
He actually made it into a magazine.

08:57.539 --> 08:58.579
Sit down.

08:58.579 --> 08:59.659
He endorsed sanitary pads.

08:59.939 --> 09:00.899
Sit.

09:03.779 --> 09:04.699
Honestly,

09:04.699 --> 09:08.299
he did act a bit improperly.

09:08.659 --> 09:11.699
But the results are good, right?

09:12.340 --> 09:14.579
Who's talking about results?

09:15.100 --> 09:17.020
This is utterly irrelevant.

09:17.020 --> 09:18.699
This has nothing to do with money.

09:19.899 --> 09:21.779
The sales figures don't lie.

09:22.299 --> 09:23.699
As long as it benefits Letao,

09:24.020 --> 09:25.020
I see no problem.

09:26.699 --> 09:27.419
What?

09:27.419 --> 09:28.659
Why do you always...

09:34.020 --> 09:34.539
Hello?

09:35.340 --> 09:37.620
Haiming, I called Huan'er,
but she didn't answer.

09:37.899 --> 09:38.659
Le'er is missing.

09:39.659 --> 09:40.260
I'll be there.

09:40.620 --> 09:41.699
Le'er is missing. Let's go.

09:43.020 --> 09:45.500
Come back! I haven't finished yet.

09:45.620 --> 09:46.500
Enough.

09:46.699 --> 09:48.939
He is becoming uncontrollable now.

09:49.299 --> 09:50.340
He never listens to me.

09:50.980 --> 09:52.460
His personality resembles yours.

10:20.936 --> 10:21.819
I didn't find her.

10:22.020 --> 10:23.260
Is there anywhere else?

10:24.419 --> 10:25.140
Let me think.

10:27.100 --> 10:28.260
I remember one place.

10:28.460 --> 10:28.980
Where?

10:32.500 --> 10:33.500
Le'er fed stray cats here

10:33.500 --> 10:34.539
after school.

10:34.899 --> 10:35.819
She might be here.

10:36.779 --> 10:37.448
Wait.

10:45.500 --> 10:47.179
This looks like Le'er's backpack.

10:47.899 --> 10:49.340
But why is her backpack here?

10:49.620 --> 10:50.140
Don't worry.

10:50.140 --> 10:52.460
Where is Le'er? Is she in trouble?

10:58.460 --> 11:00.740
Ou Xiaojue came to see me
a couple of days ago.

11:02.500 --> 11:04.659
He came to you? What for?

11:05.220 --> 11:07.460
He asked me
to arrange a meeting with you.

11:07.819 --> 11:10.059
He also asked me
to meet him at the park in the south.

11:10.659 --> 11:12.340
He seemed a bit off.

11:12.340 --> 11:13.380
So I ran away quickly.

11:23.059 --> 11:24.260
Le'er told me before

11:24.779 --> 11:26.100
that Ou Xiaojue wanted her

11:26.100 --> 11:27.419
to arrange a meeting with me.

11:28.260 --> 11:29.460
This is a secluded spot.

11:29.460 --> 11:30.419
I think she's here.

11:30.659 --> 11:31.380
Let's go up.

11:43.140 --> 11:43.740
This way.

11:48.899 --> 11:49.699
Don't talk back.

11:50.819 --> 11:51.819
It won't do you any good.

11:56.620 --> 11:59.059
I could have married
into the Cheng family.

12:00.260 --> 12:03.579
I would have had both love
and a successful career.

12:05.419 --> 12:06.659
But at this very moment,

12:07.539 --> 12:09.699
she and Gao Haiming came
to ruin my plans.

12:13.500 --> 12:14.179
Don't worry.

12:15.220 --> 12:16.179
I won't hurt you.

12:23.740 --> 12:25.340
I only want to deal with your sister.

12:25.699 --> 12:27.419
Why should I have nothing

12:27.579 --> 12:30.100
while she gets to be happy every day?

12:30.100 --> 12:32.220
Why?

12:34.140 --> 12:34.980
I have a way.

12:36.500 --> 12:38.260
Tell me why.

12:38.539 --> 12:39.220
Ou Xiaojue!

12:39.899 --> 12:40.980
Come at me!

12:41.299 --> 12:42.179
Huan'er.

12:42.179 --> 12:44.179
Shut up! Stay where you are!

12:56.980 --> 12:58.740
I underestimated you, Lin Huan'er.

12:59.340 --> 13:00.460
You actually came.

13:01.779 --> 13:02.620
What do you want?

13:03.500 --> 13:05.100
How could you do such a thing?

13:06.100 --> 13:07.779
How could I do such a thing?

13:08.100 --> 13:09.579
Isn't all this because of you?

13:09.860 --> 13:11.579
It's all your fault!

13:11.939 --> 13:13.100
What are you talking about?

13:13.659 --> 13:14.659
Think about it yourself.

13:14.899 --> 13:16.260
Dropping out was your choice.

13:16.699 --> 13:18.579
Lying to everyone was your decision.

13:19.020 --> 13:20.819
Everything resulted from your choices.

13:20.819 --> 13:21.699
You deserved it.

13:21.699 --> 13:22.779
How is this relevant to me?

13:39.260 --> 13:39.939
Lin Huan'er.

13:42.500 --> 13:43.740
You think you're a good person?

13:44.899 --> 13:46.100
You latched onto Gao Haiming.

13:47.899 --> 13:49.020
Wasn't that for money too?

13:49.980 --> 13:50.980
Don't assume everyone is

13:50.980 --> 13:52.100
as despicable as you.

13:52.500 --> 13:54.100
Did you repay the 200,000 you borrowed?

13:54.179 --> 13:55.419
Don't push your luck.

13:55.419 --> 13:56.980
Don't bring that up with me.

13:57.179 --> 13:59.659
Would I be like this today without you?

14:03.500 --> 14:04.779
Isn't your boyfriend loaded?

14:07.659 --> 14:08.500
Give me 400,000 yuan

14:09.699 --> 14:13.140
as compensation for my lost youth.

14:14.699 --> 14:15.419
No?

14:16.579 --> 14:17.819
Do it, or Lin Le'er...

14:22.020 --> 14:22.819
Huan'er.

14:24.100 --> 14:24.779
Don't be afraid.

14:52.299 --> 14:53.620
Thanks for cooperating, Miss Lin.

14:53.980 --> 14:55.699
If you're in such a situation again,

14:55.699 --> 14:56.500
don't act rashly.

14:57.020 --> 14:58.699
Without our earlier deployment today,

14:58.779 --> 14:59.899
the suspect would've fled.

14:59.899 --> 15:01.340
You'd face greater dangers.

15:02.699 --> 15:03.779
It won't happen again.

15:04.299 --> 15:05.100
Thanks, officer.

15:05.460 --> 15:06.504
Okay, that's all.

15:06.504 --> 15:07.419
We have to go.

15:07.419 --> 15:08.020
Thanks again.

15:10.740 --> 15:12.179
Let's check on him

15:12.179 --> 15:13.059
later.

15:19.500 --> 15:20.100
Doctor,

15:20.860 --> 15:22.140
how is he?

15:23.179 --> 15:24.460
He has varying degrees

15:24.460 --> 15:26.539
of soft tissue bruising on his shoulders

15:26.539 --> 15:27.299
and back.

15:27.860 --> 15:29.220
Though it's not serious,

15:29.659 --> 15:31.380
I recommend that he gets plenty of rest.

15:33.380 --> 15:34.220
Thank you, doctor.

15:47.899 --> 15:48.539
Where's Le'er?

15:49.380 --> 15:50.140
Don't worry.

15:50.899 --> 15:52.220
My dad took her home.

15:55.140 --> 15:57.340
Go rest early. I'm fine.

16:00.500 --> 16:01.939
I'll stay here with you.

16:03.020 --> 16:03.899
You get some rest.

16:10.632 --> 16:13.615
♪Entwined worries linger♪

16:14.824 --> 16:17.595
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

16:20.819 --> 16:21.620
Congratulations.

16:21.779 --> 16:23.059
Male Lead's fondness toward you

16:23.059 --> 16:24.659
has exceeded 90 percent.

16:24.980 --> 16:26.179
You'll complete the quest soon

16:26.299 --> 16:27.419
and go back.

16:27.419 --> 16:30.888
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

16:31.560 --> 16:35.012
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

16:36.008 --> 16:41.534
♪Until the world's end♪

16:43.944 --> 16:47.740
♪If I could♪

16:48.328 --> 16:51.144
♪Keep loving you♪

16:52.100 --> 16:53.579
Are you behind all of this?

16:54.260 --> 16:55.659
Ou Xiaojue was a timid guy.

16:55.659 --> 16:57.020
Why did he suddenly turn violent?

16:58.059 --> 16:59.980
To help you finish the quest faster.

17:02.059 --> 17:04.579
You're truly a vile, rotten system.

17:06.020 --> 17:07.859
They're living people!

17:08.859 --> 17:10.180
How could you

17:10.180 --> 17:11.420
manipulate everyone's fate?

17:12.579 --> 17:14.579
Even if you see them
as fictional characters,

17:15.460 --> 17:17.020
you can't be this heartless.

17:17.619 --> 17:19.260
Lin Huan'er, remember

17:19.619 --> 17:20.940
you don't belong in this world.

17:21.420 --> 17:23.339
Don't you want to go back?

17:29.099 --> 17:30.700
What about what I'm experiencing now?

17:31.980 --> 17:33.260
All here is a dream.

17:33.700 --> 17:35.260
Good or bad,

17:35.579 --> 17:37.539
it'll vanish when you wake.

17:43.059 --> 17:45.059
(If this is all virtual...)

17:46.099 --> 17:47.980
Can't the rules be flexible?

17:48.539 --> 17:49.299
For example,

17:51.099 --> 17:52.099
lower the fondness

17:52.099 --> 17:53.460
to 50 percent.

17:55.460 --> 17:57.859
Sorry, the system only reflects

17:57.859 --> 17:59.700
the male lead's true emotional changes.

18:03.940 --> 18:05.260
I just want to slow down.

18:09.020 --> 18:10.539
If this is a dream,

18:11.579 --> 18:12.819
can't I wake later?

18:15.272 --> 18:21.119
♪Until the world's end♪

18:23.112 --> 18:27.016
♪If I could♪

18:27.624 --> 18:30.376
♪Keep loving you♪

18:31.432 --> 18:33.768
♪Hearing two hearts♪

18:33.768 --> 18:38.728
♪Beating together♪

18:39.720 --> 18:43.283
♪If I could♪

18:44.379 --> 18:45.139
Sorry.

18:48.139 --> 18:49.700
Maybe you shouldn't have saved me.

18:51.900 --> 18:53.139
Why say this now?

19:02.379 --> 19:03.460
Why aren't you asleep?

19:06.579 --> 19:09.099
I'm fine. Go take care of Le'er.

19:09.579 --> 19:10.180
She's a kid.

19:15.299 --> 19:15.819
Okay.

19:18.220 --> 19:20.460
I'll visit you first thing tomorrow.

19:22.900 --> 19:23.740
Good night.

19:39.700 --> 19:40.379
Huan'er.

19:41.059 --> 19:41.700
Still awake?

19:42.180 --> 19:43.940
I thought
you weren't coming back tonight.

19:44.779 --> 19:47.059
I checked on Le'er.

19:47.900 --> 19:48.980
She was asleep,

19:49.379 --> 19:50.339
so I came back.

19:54.020 --> 19:55.299
How is Gao Haiming?

19:57.420 --> 19:58.460
He is fine.

19:58.980 --> 20:00.260
But he needs a few days of rest.

20:01.020 --> 20:03.180
Do you think Ou Xiaojue has gone crazy?

20:03.420 --> 20:05.020
He actually did something so outrageous!

20:06.779 --> 20:08.260
He is also arranged by fate.

20:09.192 --> 20:09.832
Wow.

20:10.539 --> 20:11.900
You're actually speaking for him!

20:13.500 --> 20:14.099
Mengmeng.

20:14.900 --> 20:15.700
Tell me.

20:16.700 --> 20:18.660
Why do people fall in love with someone?

20:21.460 --> 20:23.420
What reasons could there be
for falling in love?

20:23.420 --> 20:24.900
You fall in love, and that's all.

20:26.299 --> 20:27.020
What?

20:27.539 --> 20:29.740
You finally admit you like him.

20:34.536 --> 20:35.500
(There He/She Comes)

20:35.500 --> 20:38.900
Is your manga coming to an end soon?

20:41.099 --> 20:41.819
I've decided.

20:42.180 --> 20:45.180
I want them
to fall in love without regrets

20:45.180 --> 20:46.579
in my book.

20:52.460 --> 20:53.180
But...

20:55.700 --> 20:57.260
How can there be no regrets?

20:58.779 --> 21:00.139
They're in a book.

21:00.779 --> 21:02.539
Loving recklessly is the most intense.

21:10.660 --> 21:11.299
Coming.

21:12.700 --> 21:13.460
Sorry.

21:13.460 --> 21:15.420
There was a traffic jam on my way here.

21:15.420 --> 21:16.456
I helped direct traffic.

21:16.779 --> 21:17.339
It's fine.

21:17.339 --> 21:19.020
Huan'er has helped me pack up.

21:19.500 --> 21:20.980
Just help me with the boxes.

21:21.020 --> 21:21.619
Okay.

21:22.312 --> 21:23.016
Where's Huan'er?

21:23.500 --> 21:24.539
She went to the hospital.

21:25.379 --> 21:26.059
Is she sick?

21:26.299 --> 21:28.420
Gao Haiming got injured
while saving her.

21:30.700 --> 21:32.020
Why didn't he tell me?

21:32.020 --> 21:32.740
Is he okay?

21:32.808 --> 21:33.980
Huan'er will look after him.

21:33.980 --> 21:34.980
You don't need to worry.

21:35.700 --> 21:37.260
You'll just be a third wheel if you go.

21:40.968 --> 21:46.376
(Star and Firefly
Author: Guyue Linxi)

21:57.299 --> 21:57.980
Let me help.

22:08.379 --> 22:08.900
Okay.

22:10.980 --> 22:11.528
Let's go.

22:32.859 --> 22:33.420
Boss.

22:35.299 --> 22:36.859
I rushed over as soon as I heard it.

22:37.099 --> 22:37.700
I was wrong.

22:37.700 --> 22:38.420
Sorry, sir.

22:38.420 --> 22:39.619
Don't be angry.

22:39.619 --> 22:40.740
I didn't mean to anger you.

22:41.020 --> 22:43.220
Boss, I'm completely loyal.

22:44.232 --> 22:45.384
Have you ever been in love?

22:48.379 --> 22:49.059
In love?

22:49.779 --> 22:52.180
Yeah, I have,

22:52.460 --> 22:53.420
quite a few times.

22:56.779 --> 22:57.460
Well,

22:58.660 --> 23:00.020
clearly, they like each other.

23:01.980 --> 23:03.900
But they always feel like
there's no future.

23:03.900 --> 23:05.139
What kind of mindset is that?

23:07.500 --> 23:08.339
Well,

23:09.500 --> 23:11.779
isn't that like Romeo and Juliet?

23:11.779 --> 23:13.256
Or the White Snake and Xu Xian?

23:15.740 --> 23:16.539
The girl feels

23:16.539 --> 23:17.980
she's not good enough for the boy.

23:20.859 --> 23:21.859
Impossible!

23:22.859 --> 23:23.779
She is confident.

23:24.180 --> 23:25.220
She couldn't feel so.

23:26.099 --> 23:27.139
Anyway, Boss,

23:27.139 --> 23:28.180
never put yourself

23:28.180 --> 23:29.139
in danger again.

23:29.660 --> 23:31.460
What if something happens to you?

23:31.460 --> 23:33.339
If the Chairman finds out,
I'll lose my job.

23:34.299 --> 23:35.579
I'm just worried about you.

23:36.260 --> 23:37.180
I'm so worried.

23:37.339 --> 23:38.940
If you don't say it, no one will know.

23:43.099 --> 23:43.619
Boss.

23:44.099 --> 23:46.900
Were you just talking about Lin Huan'er?

23:48.020 --> 23:49.660
Look, you've thought so much about her.

23:50.099 --> 23:51.080
Yet she doesn't care.

23:51.260 --> 23:52.900
If I see her, I'll give her a...

23:52.900 --> 23:53.660
I will

23:54.500 --> 23:55.619
give her a thumbs up.

23:57.299 --> 23:58.099
Very kind of you.

24:05.940 --> 24:07.619
Take the things to the car.

24:08.299 --> 24:09.139
Okay.

24:10.260 --> 24:11.260
You guys chat.

24:11.500 --> 24:12.020
I'm off.

24:22.779 --> 24:24.020
Why aren't you resting?

24:26.500 --> 24:27.180
I'm fine.

24:27.180 --> 24:29.099
The doctor said I can be discharged.

24:29.619 --> 24:30.339
What?

24:31.260 --> 24:33.500
No, you injured your back.

24:33.700 --> 24:34.980
The back is close to the spine.

24:34.980 --> 24:36.700
There are many tendons in that area.

24:36.980 --> 24:38.500
You've injured it.

24:38.500 --> 24:40.579
It might seem fine on the surface.

24:40.579 --> 24:41.180
But

24:41.180 --> 24:42.460
the tendons might still hurt.

24:42.460 --> 24:43.700
It will affect your mobility.

24:43.980 --> 24:45.059
Don't worry

24:45.059 --> 24:45.700
about the work.

24:45.779 --> 24:47.460
I'll handle everything for you.

24:47.579 --> 24:49.379
All you need to do is rest well.

24:49.379 --> 24:51.180
No matter how good your home is,

24:51.180 --> 24:51.980
the hospital...

24:51.980 --> 24:52.779
I'm fine.

24:58.819 --> 24:59.900
How did you have it?

25:01.460 --> 25:02.379
I'm confused.

25:02.379 --> 25:03.579
Don't you have a phone?

25:03.579 --> 25:04.539
Why do you keep it?

25:06.859 --> 25:07.619
You...

25:08.379 --> 25:09.779
Did you see any messages?

25:10.220 --> 25:11.619
It kept flashing all last night.

25:12.299 --> 25:13.339
I couldn't see anything.

25:13.339 --> 25:14.379
Is it broken?

25:16.200 --> 25:16.936
(Male Lead's fondness toward you)

25:16.936 --> 25:17.832
(rose to 95 percent overnight.)

25:19.656 --> 25:20.200
(Male Lead's fondness toward you)

25:20.232 --> 25:21.704
(rose to 95 percent overnight.)

25:22.819 --> 25:23.420
What?

25:23.779 --> 25:25.579
What were you thinking about all night?

25:28.379 --> 25:29.579
Nothing.

25:31.299 --> 25:31.819
Then...

25:33.339 --> 25:34.299
Let's just go.

25:34.819 --> 25:35.400
Okay.

26:00.740 --> 26:01.260
Let's go.

26:02.859 --> 26:03.432
It's fine.

26:05.420 --> 26:05.960
Careful.

26:14.339 --> 26:16.859
Mr. Gao, everything has been arranged.

26:17.180 --> 26:18.539
The company documents will be sent

26:18.539 --> 26:19.460
to your home.

26:20.779 --> 26:21.339
Good.

26:23.779 --> 26:26.900
But I've had too much work to do

26:27.059 --> 26:27.819
recently.

26:28.099 --> 26:29.980
Could I trouble Miss Lin

26:30.339 --> 26:31.940
to deliver the documents

26:32.379 --> 26:35.099
and assist with organizing them?

26:39.980 --> 26:40.980
I'm afraid I can't.

26:41.299 --> 26:45.260
Because I have some unfinished tasks.

26:45.500 --> 26:46.980
This is your current task.

26:47.379 --> 26:48.700
Leave other tasks to colleagues.

26:49.980 --> 26:51.220
But I'm afraid

26:51.220 --> 26:53.299
nobody can do them well.

26:57.460 --> 26:58.260
How about this?

26:58.700 --> 26:59.740
I'll go back to work too.

26:59.740 --> 27:00.900
This minor injury is nothing.

27:00.900 --> 27:02.180
No, you need to stay home.

27:05.740 --> 27:06.819
I have an idea.

27:07.420 --> 27:09.059
You go get the documents,

27:09.579 --> 27:11.460
and I'll stay to look after Mr. Gao.

27:11.660 --> 27:13.020
When you bring the documents over,

27:13.020 --> 27:14.420
I'll go back with you.

27:17.740 --> 27:18.299
Okay.

27:18.660 --> 27:19.299
Thanks.

27:32.139 --> 27:33.500
Mr. Gao, I have urgent work to do.

27:33.500 --> 27:34.260
I have to go.

27:41.299 --> 27:41.940
What's wrong?

27:43.848 --> 27:44.379
A bit dizzy.

27:44.379 --> 27:45.260
Go.

27:48.460 --> 27:49.180
He's left.

27:53.379 --> 27:54.420
I'll help you inside.

27:57.020 --> 27:57.740
Mr. Gao is back!

27:59.339 --> 28:00.500
Mr. Gao, Miss Lin.

28:00.500 --> 28:01.020
Thank you.

28:01.579 --> 28:02.900
Oh, you two came together?

28:02.900 --> 28:03.859
Is everything done?

28:06.779 --> 28:08.099
Yes, all done.

28:09.819 --> 28:11.059
Stop pretending.

28:14.539 --> 28:16.260
Miss Lin, thank you

28:16.260 --> 28:17.500
for taking care of Mr. Gao.

28:17.900 --> 28:19.460
You both didn't sleep well, did you?

28:19.460 --> 28:21.539
It's fine.
Please help him inside to rest.

28:22.220 --> 28:23.180
I just remembered!

28:23.180 --> 28:24.460
I haven't trimmed bushes yet.

28:24.460 --> 28:25.260
I'll go do that.

28:25.980 --> 28:26.700
Oh, right.

28:26.700 --> 28:28.139
I'm cooking food on the stove.

28:30.900 --> 28:31.579
Thank you.

28:44.872 --> 28:45.864
(Agency Contracts)

28:53.099 --> 28:55.339
Do you have to read so many documents
every day?

28:56.264 --> 28:57.416
Just the tip of the iceberg.

28:58.500 --> 28:59.940
Why not read electronic documents?

29:01.020 --> 29:02.900
Important documents are archived
in hard copy.

29:40.859 --> 29:42.299
This part is wrong.

29:42.299 --> 29:43.299
Please correct this here.

29:54.856 --> 29:56.552
(Project Management Materials)

30:07.460 --> 30:09.339
Mr. Gao,
it's time to change your dressing.

30:13.020 --> 30:13.779
Do you know how?

30:18.819 --> 30:19.539
Stop! Why?

30:20.980 --> 30:22.020
To change the dressing.

30:22.859 --> 30:23.819
I'm unbuttoning it.

30:25.299 --> 30:26.139
Right, go on.

30:36.980 --> 30:37.619
My back.

30:39.980 --> 30:40.619
Yes.

30:50.220 --> 30:50.980
Does it hurt?

30:52.139 --> 30:52.700
No.

30:56.660 --> 30:57.299
Huan'er.

30:58.700 --> 31:00.139
You studied psychology, right?

31:00.980 --> 31:01.819
I have a question.

31:03.139 --> 31:04.260
A friend of mine

31:04.619 --> 31:08.099
clearly likes a guy,

31:08.099 --> 31:09.859
but she's afraid to get close to him.

31:10.220 --> 31:11.819
What's the psychological reason
for that?

31:12.660 --> 31:14.819
That sounds like avoidant attachment.

31:15.460 --> 31:16.940
It's a psychological phenomenon.

31:17.299 --> 31:18.059
The main sign

31:18.059 --> 31:19.859
is turning away from closeness

31:19.859 --> 31:21.020
and strong independence...

31:23.500 --> 31:24.099
Wait.

31:24.099 --> 31:25.900
You think I am...

31:25.900 --> 31:28.700
How do we solve this situation?

31:31.579 --> 31:33.700
Anyway, I'm not avoidantly attached.

31:34.859 --> 31:36.420
It's just that my situation...

31:37.859 --> 31:38.660
It's complicated.

31:39.020 --> 31:39.579
Okay.

31:40.139 --> 31:40.819
It's done.

31:41.260 --> 31:41.940
You rest now.

32:07.779 --> 32:08.539
How complicated?

32:10.859 --> 32:11.379
Well...

32:13.059 --> 32:13.859
Actually,

32:13.859 --> 32:15.260
it's not that complicated.

32:16.220 --> 32:17.020
It's just...

32:18.900 --> 32:21.059
It just takes time and patience.

32:25.020 --> 32:25.660
Alright.

32:27.460 --> 32:28.139
I can wait.

32:29.619 --> 32:30.819
If not today, then tomorrow.

32:31.980 --> 32:33.299
What if it doesn't work either?

32:35.379 --> 32:36.700
If tomorrow doesn't work,

32:37.700 --> 32:38.700
the day after tomorrow.

32:39.299 --> 32:40.579
Or the day after that.

32:42.740 --> 32:44.339
But what if the day after tomorrow

32:44.339 --> 32:45.299
or the day after that

32:45.299 --> 32:46.180
still doesn't work?

32:47.819 --> 32:48.940
There will be a day.

32:53.608 --> 32:56.168
(Examination Room)

33:08.424 --> 33:08.980
(From: Silly Goose)

33:08.980 --> 33:11.379
(Stay calm.
Don't let anything throw you off.)

33:16.180 --> 33:17.379
(To: Silly Goose)
(How did you know?)

33:17.900 --> 33:19.420
(My hands are sweating.)

33:29.700 --> 33:31.379
- This isn't great.
- Not great.

33:31.432 --> 33:33.339
(Judge)

33:33.339 --> 33:33.980
Next.

33:34.819 --> 33:36.500
Next up, Han Meimei,

33:36.579 --> 33:38.579
Zhu Mengmeng, Xu Jingke,

33:38.700 --> 33:40.700
Li Xining, and Li Xiao,

33:40.700 --> 33:42.180
follow me inside for the assessment.

33:42.379 --> 33:43.260
It's my turn!

33:43.260 --> 33:44.020
I'm going in now.

33:44.020 --> 33:44.900
(From: Silly Goose)
Okay. Go for it!

33:44.900 --> 33:46.740
(You've succeeded
by stepping on the stage.)

33:47.180 --> 33:47.859
(See you later.)

33:47.859 --> 33:48.936
You're next.

33:49.579 --> 33:50.619
Go for it!

34:02.420 --> 34:03.020
Next.

34:15.699 --> 34:16.259
Next.

34:23.400 --> 34:24.820
Please get started.

34:32.460 --> 34:32.980
Not bad.

34:38.500 --> 34:39.099
Thank you.

34:43.900 --> 34:44.699
Next.

34:56.072 --> 34:59.055
♪Entwined worries linger♪

35:00.264 --> 35:03.035
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

35:04.936 --> 35:10.849
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

35:12.646 --> 35:15.706
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

35:16.872 --> 35:20.324
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

35:21.320 --> 35:26.846
♪Until the world's end♪

35:29.256 --> 35:33.052
♪If I could♪

35:33.640 --> 35:36.456
♪Keep loving you♪

35:37.480 --> 35:39.880
♪Hearing two hearts♪

35:39.880 --> 35:44.796
♪Beating together♪

35:45.768 --> 35:49.632
♪If I could♪

35:49.632 --> 35:52.872
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

35:53.928 --> 36:01.253
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

36:02.312 --> 36:05.256
♪Entwined worries linger♪

36:06.504 --> 36:09.256
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

36:11.112 --> 36:16.892
